  "text": "My care\n/\nOne-time care\n\nONE-TIME CARE\n\nEleanor Bennett · Thu, Sep 10\n\nSep 10, 10:00 AM · Raleigh, NC\n\nFinding a caregiver\nRequest #4\nGet help\nCare story\nOverview\nCaregivers\nCare details\nHelp\n\nCAREGIVER REPLIES\n\nReview replies below\n\nOpen profile details only when you need more context. The main actions stay on each caregiver card.\n\nInvite someone\nFilter or sort caregivers\nStatus\nAll caregivers\nInterested\nSaved\nHired\nDeclined\nNot selected\nWithdrawn\nSort\nLatest first\nOldest first\nRate high-low\nRate low-high\nCertifications & training\nAny\n⌄\nRequired certifications & training\n\nChoose what the caregiver must currently have. Select more than one to require all of them.\n\nCPR\nFirst Aid\nBasic Life Support (BLS)\nCertified Nursing Assistant (CNA)\nHome Health Aide (HHA)\nPersonal Care Aide (PCA)\nMedication Aide or Technician\nDementia care training\nOther certification or training\n\n2 caregivers match the applicant filters\n\nCaregivers who replied\n\nReview their reply, profile, or start a conversation.\n\nSM\n\nSofia Martinez\n\nSaved\n\nRaleigh, NC\n\n7 years experience\n4.9\n24 reviews\nReliability 98%\nProfile details\nIdentity verified\nBackground check\nTop Caregiver\nAccepting clients\n\nI enjoy helping older adults keep a familiar routine, prepare meals, and stay connected.\n\nCompanionship\nMeal preparation\nLight housekeeping\n\nLanguages: English\n\nI would be happy to help Ellie with lunch, a little tidying, and conversation. I am available for your requested schedule.\n\nHire Sofia\nView profile\nOpen chat\nMore options for Sofia\nSave for later\nNot this caregiver\nJW\n\nJames Wilson\n\nInterested\n\nRaleigh, NC\n\n5 years experience\n4.8\n18 reviews\nReliability 98%\nProfile details\nIdentity verified\nBackground check\nTop Caregiver\nAccepting clients\n\nPatient, dependable support with companionship, everyday tasks, and gentle encouragement.\n\nCompanionship\nMeal preparation\nLight housekeeping\n\nLanguages: English\n\nI would be happy to help Ellie with lunch, a little tidying, and conversation. I am available for your requested schedule.\n\nHire James\nView profile\nSave & chat\nMore options for James\nSave for later\nNot this caregiver\n\nLOOKING FOR A SPECIFIC PERSON?\n\nInvite someone you know\n\nSearch by name and invite them without leaving this request or choosing the request again.\n\nSearch and invite\nPeople you invited\n\nInvitations are separate from caregivers who replied.\n\n0 total\nNo active invitations yet.\nRecommended caregivers\n\nKeep reviewing replies above, or invite another matching caregiver if no one feels right yet.\n\nAR\n\nAisha Robinson\n\nSame ZIP service area - Match score 124\n\n5.0\n31 reviews\nIdentity verified\nBackground check\nTop caregiver\n\nSame ZIP service area - Matches requested time window\n\nInvite Aisha\nOC\n\nOliver Chen\n\nSame ZIP service area - Match score 124\n\n4.8\n12 reviews\nIdentity verified\nBackground check\nTop caregiver\n\nSame ZIP service area - Matches requested time window\n\nInvite Oliver\nER\n\nE2E Ready Caregiver\n\nSame ZIP service area - Match score 114\n\n4.9\n14 reviews\nIdentity verified\nBackground check\nTop caregiver\nCPR\n · \nReported by caregiver\nMemory loss, dementia, or Alzheimer's support\nLimited mobility or fall-risk support\n\nSame ZIP service area - Matches requested time window\n\nInvite E2E\n\n© 2026 LoLo\n\nLegal links",
